{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30406","headline":"薛廷范从事自宣城至因赠 · 赵嘏","name":"薛廷范从事自宣城至因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年从事霍嫖姚，来自枫林度柳桥。\n金管别筵楼灼灼，玉溪回首马萧萧。\n清风气调真君辈，知己风流满圣朝。\n独有故人愁欲死，晚檐疎雨动空瓢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}